{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_0191LfRyT1B6FQxYKQtHFNJ7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Comprehensive Negative Word List\n2\t# Complete reference of AI-favored words to avoid in technical documentation\n3\t#\n4\t# Format:\n5\t#   word_to_block -> replacement1, replacement2, replacement3\n6\t#   OR\n7\t#   word_to_block  (plugin will find appropriate replacement)\n8\t#\n9\t# Comments starting with # are allowed and ignored\n10\t#\n11\t# This is a reference list. For a minimal starter list, copy from:\n12\t# knowledge-base/negative-words.example.txt to .copyedit-negative-words.txt\n13\t\n14\t# ============================================================================\n15\t# HARD STOPS - Most egregious AI markers\n16\t# ============================================================================\n17\tdelve -> explore, examine, investigate, analyze\n18\tfoster -> encourage, support, promote, enable\n19\tleverage -> use, apply, utilize\n20\trobust -> reliable, strong, solid, stable\n21\tsheer -> pure, complete, total\n22\tparamount -> critical, essential, vital, crucial\n23\tutilize -> use\n24\tmeticulous -> careful, thorough, detailed\n25\tpivotal -> critical, key, important\n26\t\n27\t# ============================================================================\n28\t# OVERUSED AI VERBS\n29\t# ============================================================================\n30\tharness -> use, apply, employ\n31\tunderscore -> emphasize, highlight, show\n32\telucidate -> explain, clarify, describe\n33\tfacilitate -> enable, help, support\n34\texemplify -> demonstrate, show, illustrate\n35\tunderscore -> emphasize, highlight\n36\tnavigate -> handle, manage, work with\n37\tstreamline -> simplify, improve, optimize\n38\taugment -> enhance, extend, add to\n39\tbolster -> strengthen, support, reinforce\n40\tspearhead -> lead, drive, initiate\n41\t\n42\t# =======================================================================