========================================================================\na multitude of -> many, numerous\na plethora of -> many, numerous\nin the context of -> in, for, regarding\nwith regard to -> about, regarding, concerning\nin terms of -> for, in, regarding\ndue to the fact that -> because, since\nin light of the fact that -> because, since\nit goes without saying -> (omit or state directly)\n","numLines":137,"startLine":1,"totalLines":137}}}
